     " < 0"
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"f6ebd3e9-420f-4e6c-9fc3-d54c45eed1cd"], 
    Cell["the quotients of order at most 1100, in increasing order", 
     "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"8296d74b-39d0-4998-86bb-7997f352828a"]}
  }]], "2ColumnTableMod",ExpressionUUID->"4c67184e-3a01-4bd4-ac02-\
bfb74d225432"],

Cell["\<\
A uniform map is built on a map of its regular parent type by rectification \
and truncation. These keep the surface, so the uniform map has the genus of \
its parent.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ef91ca3f-3069-4d71-97bd-974836728f1c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The genus of the map can exceed the least genus of a surface on which ",
 StyleBox["g", "TI"],
 " embeds."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"7c8c8066-68ed-4dc6-ac6a-a807a2b9843a"]
}, Open  ]],

