Cell["\<\
On a surface that is not orientable the value is not a number of handles. The \
complete graph on six vertices carries the hemi-icosahedron, a {3, 5} map on \
the projective plane, of Euler characteristic 1:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"fa329a36-847b-4627-b610-f350cef2860c"],

